# C++

- Format with [.clang-format](.clang-format); CI runs `ament_clang_format`.
- The C++ observation layout in
  [observation_layout.hpp](src/common/f1tenth_common/include/f1tenth_common/observation_layout.hpp)
  is a **hand-kept mirror** of the Python contract
  ([libs/f1tenth_contract](libs/f1tenth_contract/)). If you change the layout, keep
  the parity test green
  ([test_obs_parity.cpp](src/common/f1tenth_common/test/test_obs_parity.cpp)). See
  [docs/observation_contract.md](docs/observation_contract.md).
- Keep unit tests free of ROS runtime dependencies where possible — test the plain
  logic.
- Don't edit vendored packages under `src/vehicle/**` without coordinating (see
  [src/vehicle/VENDORED.md](src/vehicle/VENDORED.md)).
